2 CONC d States under authority granted by Article I, Section 2 of the United States Constitution. It was conducted in April 1930, except in Alaska, where it was conducted in late 1929. Until 2012 the 1930 Census is the latest available to the public, d
2 CONC ue to 72-year privacy laws. It is based on actual counts of persons living in residential structures.
