2 CONT New York: Buffalo, Lewiston, Niagara Falls, and Rochester (1902-1954); Alexandria Bay, Cape Vincent, Champlain, Clayton, Fort Covington, Mooers, Rouses Point, Thousand Island Bridge, and Trout River (1929-1956); Hogansburg, Malone, Morristown, Ny
